Lago (getlago.com) | Product &amp; Engineering | Full-Time, Perm Hiring<p>Lago is the billing platform that gives teams full transparency, control and flexibility to manage and scale any pricing model.
As the leading open-source billing platform, we empower businesses to build flexible pricing models and scale with confidence. We’ve raised over $22 million in funding from top-tier investors including Y Combinator and FirstMark, reflecting strong confidence in our vision and growth.</p><p>Open Roles:
